  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Electrofire Wizard is the twelfth and the last Builder Base Troop unlocked once the Builder Barracks is upgraded to level 12, which requires Builder Hall level 10 to unlock. He is the Builder Base counterpart of the Wizard.",
    "In Electro Mode, the Electrofire Wizard will use chain lightning attacks that can hit up to four different targets that are 1 tile apart from each other, though he prepares this attack slowly. The damage decreases by 20% per target hit after the first."
  ],
